# Credentials
.env

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Robinhood session cache
*.pickle

# Node
web/node_modules/
web/dist/

# PDF reports
reports/*.pdf

# Local Claude Code config (harness state, not app code)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Quote extracts — data, not code (flat-file extraction output)
data/extracts/

# Private research findings — methodology is public (docs/RANKER_SPEC.md),
# results are not. Only the explanatory README stub is tracked.
docs/private/*
!docs/private/README.md

# personal case-study documents live in docs/private/ (untracked); keep the old path ignored too
docs/POD_SELECTION_CASE_STUDY.md

# Impeccable (design skill) — ephemeral/runtime state and the vendored detector binary.
# Design tooling stays local (public repo; internal, not secret): the Impeccable skill, its agents,
# and every working file under .impeccable/ (design.json, config, critiques, briefs). The app owns its
# tokens in web/src/index.css + web/tailwind.config.js; DESIGN.md is the human record. Untracked 2026-09-24.
.claude/skills/impeccable/
.claude/agents/impeccable-*.md
.impeccable/

# Screener e2e screenshots (web/tests/e2e/*.mjs write here)
web/tests/e2e/out/
